The spoiler says:

"Nymphs often (one in two) have potions of object detection, but they 
also can have other random potions."

Nothing about carrying any potions. Nymph may be generated with the 
following potions: object detection (50%), one of healing, extra healing 
or full healing and one of speed, invisibility or gain level.

The latter six potions can be found on almost any intelligent corporeal 
non-animal monster.

As a death drop any potion can be generated when the nymph dies.

